---
import Layout from "layouts/LayoutLandingZh.astro";
import OpenArmViewer from "components/OpenArmViewer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Robotics Hackathon - GOSIM Paris 2026"
  description="与 LeRobot 团队合作的实战机器人黑客松。使用真实机器人，完全开源。"
  navDarkMode={true}
  navBackground="header-home"
>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero-section">
      <div class="hero-background">
        <video
          autoplay
          loop
          muted
          playsinline
          webkit-playsinline
        >
          <source src="https://openarm.dev/videos/kv.mp4#t=5" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
        <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1 class="hero-title">机器人黑客松</h1>
        <p class="hero-details">2026年5月5-6日 &middot; OpenPlatform, STATION F，巴黎</p>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">使用真实机器人。完全开源。</p>
        <div class="hero-intro">
          <h2>实战机器人黑客松</h2>
          <p>
            机器人黑客松是一场以 OpenArm（全开源人形机械臂）为核心的实战黑客松。整套系统完全开源，具有潜在的工业应用价值。无论你是资深机器人工程师还是充满好奇的创客，这都是你用真实机器人打造创新作品的绝佳机会。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-people">
          <div class="hero-people-group">
            <h3>Organizer</h3>
            <div class="hero-people-row">
              <a href="https://unaite.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="person-card">
                <img src="/images/speakers/unaite-logo.jpg" alt="Unaite" class="person-photo" />
                <span class="person-name">Unaite</span>
                <span class="person-role">AI Student Federation</span>
              </a>
              <a href="https://github.com/haixuanTao" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="person-card">
                <img src="/images/speakers/haixuan-tao.jpg" alt="Haixuan Xavier Tao" class="person-photo" />
                <span class="person-name">Haixuan Xavier Tao</span>
                <span class="person-role">Founder @ 1ms.ai</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Call for Participation Section -->
    <section class="cfp-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>参赛征集</h2>
        <p class="cfp-intro">我们正在寻找有才华的机器人工程师，将最前沿的模型应用于实体硬件——以期提升社区对解决机器人抓取和操作相关开放挑战的关注。</p>
        <p class="cfp-intro">我们希望解决的任务包括：</p>
        <ul class="cfp-tasks">
          <li>拼装和拆卸板件</li>
          <li>手对手抓取</li>
          <li>抓取和放置各种物体</li>
          <li>将液体倒入杯中</li>
          <li>料箱拣选</li>
          <li>整理和摆放正式餐桌</li>
          <li>折叠和展开布料</li>
          <li>接收人递过来的物品</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="cfp-details">每队 3–5 人，总计约 50 名参赛者。每支队伍配备 1 台实体 OpenArm 进行开发。同时提供远程物理访问——代码在仿真环境验证通过后，即可从家中或学校远程控制机器人。</p>
        <a href="mailto:tao.xavier@1ms.ai?subject=Joining GOSIM Robotics Hackathon" class="cta-button">加入黑客松</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hardware Section -->
    <section class="hardware-section">
      <div class="hardware-background">
        <div class="hardware-gradient"></div>
        <div class="hardware-viewer">
          <OpenArmViewer />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hardware-content">
        <h2>使用 OpenArm</h2>
        <ul class="hardware-specs-list">
          <li><strong>7 自由度</strong>人形机械臂，633mm 臂展</li>
          <li><strong>6kg 峰值负载</strong>，5.5kg 单臂重量</li>
          <li><strong>远程操控套件</strong>——每队 2 条机械臂 + 操控臂</li>
          <li><strong>1kHz CAN-FD</strong> 控制，精准响应</li>
          <li><strong>可反驱 &amp; 高柔顺性</strong>，确保安全的人机交互</li>
          <li><strong>完全开源</strong>——CAD、URDF、固件、控制软件</li>
          <li><strong>兼容</strong> LeRobot、dora-rs、ROS2、MuJoCo 和 Isaac Lab</li>
          <li><strong>仿真环境</strong>活动前开放，团队可提前开发</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://openarm.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-button">了解更多关于 OpenArm</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Partnership Section -->
    <section class="partnership-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>合作与赞助</h2>
        <p class="intro-text">
          合作伙伴将获得：活动网站上的名称展示、现场标识、屏幕展示、易拉宝以及社交活动参与权。黑客松展示人形尺寸的机器人，具有工业级应用场景（包括叠衣模型），整套技术栈完全开源。
        </p>
        <p class="intro-text">
          有兴趣支持下一代开源机器人技术？欢迎联系我们成为赞助商。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Venue Section -->
    <section class="venue-section">
      <div class="venue-background">
        <img src="/images/openplatform-stationf.jpeg" alt="STATION F - OpenPlatform" />
        <div class="venue-overlay"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="venue-content">
        <h2>场地</h2>
        <h3>STATION F — OpenPlatform，巴黎</h3>
        <p>活动在全球最大的创业园区 STATION F 的 OpenPlatform 举办——配备桌椅和电源插座的开放式协作空间，活动期间每天早8点至晚8点开放。</p>
        <a href="https://gosim.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-button">立即报名</a>
      </div>
    </section>


</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hero Section */
  .hero-section {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 500px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-background {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .hero-background video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(14, 23, 42, 0.7) 0%, rgba(30, 58, 95, 0.5) 50%, rgba(14, 122, 255, 0.3) 100%);
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding: clamp(20px, 6vw, 64px);
    padding-top: clamp(80px, 12vw, 140px);
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-badges {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .badge {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4.2vw, 60px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin: 0.2em 0;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .hero-details {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 20px);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 20px);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0;
  }

  .hero-intro {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .hero-intro h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .hero-intro p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Hero People */
  .hero-people {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .hero-people-group h3 {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .hero-people-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .person-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .person-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .person-photo {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .person-card:hover .person-photo {
    border-color: #0e7aff;
  }

  .person-name {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .person-role {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Common */
  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(20px, 5vw, 60px);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: #0f172a;
    text-align: left;
  }

  /* Call for Participation Section */
  .cfp-section {
    padding: 60px 0;
    background: #f8fafc;
  }

  .cfp-section h2 {
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  .cfp-intro {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #334155;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cfp-tasks {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cfp-tasks li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cfp-tasks li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.6em;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #0e7aff;
  }

  .cfp-details {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #334155;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Partnership Section */
  .partnership-section {
    padding: 40px 0;
    background: #fff;
  }

  /* Venue Section */
  .venue-section {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 50vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #0e1729;
  }

  .venue-background {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .venue-background img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    filter: blur(4px);
  }

  .venue-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: rgba(14, 40, 80, 0.6);
  }

  .venue-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    padding: clamp(40px, 8vw, 80px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 60px);
  }

  .venue-content h2 {
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .venue-content h3 {
    color: #60a5fa;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
  }

  .venue-content p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  /* Hardware Section */
  .hardware-section {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 500px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hardware-background {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .hardware-gradient {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e3a5f 40%, #0e7aff 100%);
  }

  .hardware-viewer {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 50%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .hardware-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px) clamp(20px, 6vw, 64px);
  }

  .hardware-content h2 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hardware-specs-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    max-width: 550px;
  }

  .hardware-specs-list li {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .hardware-specs-list li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.6em;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #0e7aff;
  }

  .hardware-specs-list strong {
    color: #fff;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hardware-viewer {
      width: 100%;
      opacity: 0.3;
    }
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #0e7aff;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 14px 36px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    background: #0b63d1;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .cta-button-outline {
    background: transparent;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .cta-button-outline:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-color: #fff;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .category-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .category-scene {
      min-height: 120px;
    }

    .category-info {
      border-left: none;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
